    "title": "Bella Hadid Oozes Glamor in Sheer Lace Top for Revolve Event - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Evolve Editors ,\n1 hours ago Photo Credit: Gilbert Flores/Variety via Getty Images Bella Hadid stepped out at a Revolve event in Los Angeles and turned the launch into a mood. The model appeared against a glowing amber backdrop as REVOLVE Los Angeles celebrated its debut after launching on March 9, with Bella Hadid fronting the line as its first ambassador.\nBella Hadid stuns in sheer lace top with capri pants for Revolve event in LA Have a look at Bella Hadid in a sheer lace top:\nThe Revolve event also worked as a live extension of the brand’s campaign, which Vogue described as centered on elevated staples, leather pieces, capris, and sleek eveningwear shaped by an LA point of view.\nFor the night, the model wore a black leather jacket, shrugged off the shoulders over a sheer lace camisole, then added slim capri pants and pointed slingback heels. The lace top stayed delicate against the tougher leather, while a pendant necklace, wristwatch, and bronzed glam kept the styling clean. Caramel waves and fringe looked extra edgy. Hadid’s outfit matched the label’s pitch: polished, body-conscious, and built for after-dark dressing.\nOriginally written by Santanu Das on Reality Tea .\nThe post Bella Hadid Oozes Glamor in Sheer Lace Top for Revolve Event appeared first on theFashionSpot .",
